        "summary": "macOS vibrancy: translucent chrome over the sidebar material",
        "body": "The window now carries the NSVisualEffectView sidebar material;\nthe rail, sidebar, titlebar and statusbar go translucent so the\ndesktop blurs through (Fork's frosted look) while content panes stay\nopaque for readability. nativeTheme follows the in-app theme so the\nglass matches a forced light/dark; non-mac platforms keep solid\ncolors (preload exposes the platform for the renderer to decide).",
