        "summary": "Dedicated settings panel; unify all icons on Lucide",
        "body": "A Fork-style preferences modal (appearance: theme/language as\nsegmented controls; integration: agent command and ism binary path,\nsaved on change, Esc/backdrop to close, app version in the footer)\nreplaces the two raw selects in the statusbar. Every icon is now\nLucide (ISC) at a consistent stroke: toolbar verbs, sidebar views,\nproject-rail add, terminal and the new settings gear — SF Symbols\nthemselves are licensed for Apple-platform rendering only and cannot\nbe bundled into an Electron app.",
